  2430	def test_a_malformed_decision_is_invalid_never_infra(tmp_path, ci_env):
  2431	    """CF-1: exit 3 (INVALID), never 1 (INFRA) and never a traceback.
  2432	
  2433	    The distinction is load-bearing: release.yml routes INFRA through
  2434	    CEO_PAIR_RAIL_VERDICT_OPTIONAL, so a malformed decision leaving by the
  2435	    infra door would be waivable by a repository variable.
